# Build tooling for the app sources under apps-src/.
node_modules/

# GENERATED, not committed. CI builds the app UIs from apps-src/ into their
# packages, compiles index.json from what it produced, and publishes both to
# GitHub Pages - so the registry a box fetches is built from source on every
# merge instead of being a snapshot someone remembered to regenerate.
apps/*/web/
index.json
_site/
